category: Libs
requires: libmailio2 pkg-config
sdesc: "Cross platform C++ library for MIME format and SMTP, POP3 and IMAP protocols (development)"
ldesc: "mailio is a cross platform C++ library for MIME format and SMTP, POP3 and IMAP
protocols. It is based on the standard C++ 17 and Boost library."
external-source: mailio

